# Imagery: position -> WMS layers comes off the BPartners API itself (REACT_APP_BPARTNERS_API_URL):
# GET /map/layers/actual and /map/layers?lat=..&lon=.., on the signed-in Cognito token. Each answer carries
# a secureLinkToken, sent on every imagery cell as token (its value) and expires (its expiresAtEpochSecond)
# — no session token ever reaches the GeoServer.
# The GeoData lambda below is now only the address geocoder (GET {REACT_APP_GEODATA_API_URL}/geocode?address=..),
# on an x-api-key; leave the key blank to use the signed-in account's own. The former REACT_APP_WMS_RESOLVER
# and REACT_APP_WMS_RESOLVER_API_KEY are still read as a fallback.
REACT_APP_GEODATA_API_URL=xxx
REACT_APP_GEODATA_API_KEY=xxx
# Same-origin base the imagery cells are fetched from (the annotator reads them with fetch, and the GeoServer
# sends no CORS headers — the secure link answers for auth, not for CORS). Blank means /wms-proxy, the Vite
# dev server's proxy to GEOSERVER_ORIGIN. A deployed build has no such proxy and MUST set this to one of its own.
REACT_APP_WMS_TILE_BASE_URL=
# GeoServer origin the dev proxy forwards /wms-proxy to. Blank means http://35.181.83.111.
GEOSERVER_ORIGIN=
REACT_APP_WMS_BASE_URL=
# Meters added on every side of the traced roof before asking for the 3D model. Blank keeps the library's
# default (2 m); 0 sends the roof as traced.
REACT_APP_ROOF_MODEL_MARGIN_M=
# Debug knobs on the generated roof cleanup. Blank keeps the library's defaults.
# Meters within which two generated roof corners are merged into one (default 0.5 m); 0 turns snapping off.
REACT_APP_ROOF_SNAP_TOLERANCE_M=
# Meters a generated roof corner may sit off its ring's path and still be dropped (default 0.5 m); 0 turns it off.
REACT_APP_ROOF_SIMPLIFY_TOLERANCE_M=
# true/false: refuse a corner drag that lands closer to another corner of the same pan (default true).
REACT_APP_ROOF_NEAR_VERTEX_BLOCK_ENABLED=
# true/false: once the analysis or the 3D generation has run, close the 2D tab for good — the emprise they
# answer for stops being retraceable. Blank keeps the library's default (false), every tab reachable.
REACT_APP_ROOF_DISABLE_SWITCH_BACK=
